+### Design health / refactor and persisted-data decisions
+Posture: bounded integration correction. LF001 alone is **Local Implementation Defect**. Overall cause: **Missing Invariant / Boundary Or Ownership Issue** across live snapshots, two frontend presentation owners and asynchronous publication. **Refactor needed now, narrowly:** complete the existing snapshot DTO and root aggregation, establish a public call-scoped child termination boundary in the existing collaboration store, and correct its publication order/ownership. No new root coordinator, generic command framework, queue, retained receipt ledger or activity cache. Reuse the implemented activity store and input-state handler; do not duplicate their policy.
