+**Stored data Not Affected.** `AgentRunCollaborationPackageSnapshot` is an ephemeral read model, not `AgentRunCollaborationTreeFile`. Current tree/message stores and sender-aware raw trace readers/writers remain unchanged. Live queue/recovery snapshots are never written to the tree or recovered from conversation text. A stored-only inspection explicitly supplies `inputStates: []`; dormant children have Offline/null recovery and no fabricated run instance. Native terminal activity retention remains SR034's bounded in-memory composition, not cold reconstruction. Migration/old-version branches/new schemaVersion/startup gate: **N/A**. Existing released migration and sender provenance contracts remain applicable; no new transformation is selected.
