+### Exact child confirmation boundary and sequencing (DI001.b)
+**Selected local shape:** extend `agentRunCollaborationStore` with a public **beginHostTermination(hostRunId)** returning a bounded call-scoped handle with synchronous `confirm()` and idempotent `finish()` operations. Names are concrete implementation guidance, not a new wire contract. Its private ownership is disposed after the request; it stores no durable result and is not a retry/admission ledger. `agentRunStore` calls only this public boundary, not child context maps, child services or child activity reconciliation internals. Host reconciliation remains at its existing owner. Add a read-only `listAgentContextEntries()` to AgentRunCollaborationContext to enumerate all exact children, analogous to Org; callers never reach its private map.
