+1. Capture the current bound-node revision and concrete request/stream owner **before the first await**. For inspection, bind ownership to that exact in-flight attempt in the existing inspections slot; deleting/replacing it on attach, Stop, release or newer inspection invalidates its result. `finally` may delete only its own slot. `null` result and error callbacks require the same guard as non-null results. Do not let an old read erase a new context or an old `onInactive` remove a newer service.
